notes.content:
Hey Film Directors! 

Here is another little patch while we're busy with a big update. This time it has something to offer to ScreenPlay pro-players with the ability to choose which flank to cast your card. Get ready for the Build 28.19!

- New more intuitive trigger system;
- (Experimental) Choosing flank on cast;
- (Experimental) Better cards in hand placement;
- Option to exclude bots in ladder.

🔉 Added sound and music volume options.

🩹 Fixed:
[list]
[*] crash when playing Tag-In in multiplayer;
[*] background disappearing in the menu when pressing the "B" button;
[*] crash with frequent clicks in the Collection; 
[*] problems with accepting an invite to the submenu;  
[*] crash when connecting to a multiplayer session. 
[/list]
